      "If an ATDD actor still returns REVISE, do not stop or retry it. Spawn exactly one fresh report-only <atdd-task-name>_adjudication1 actor with fork_turns=none and the manifest process-judge model/effort; its first tuple is scope=<story> control=atdd-adjudication actor=<task-name> persona=test-reviewer. Give it only the frozen story contract, ATDD report, protected-path rules, and REVISE findings. Persist that exact typed actor phase/role. It must end ACTOR_RESULT=PASS plus ATDD_ADJUDICATION=OVERRULE or ATDD_ADJUDICATION=UPHOLD.",
